# BANK-04 (#271): keep secrets and the private checkout out of the docker build
# context. The only image built from the repo root is apps/api/Dockerfile, which
# COPYs pyproject.toml, README.md, alembic.ini, packages/, apps/api/, contract/,
# alembic/ and deploy/wheelhouse/. None of those is listed here; a test keeps it
# that way.
#
# CI checks the private Cortex repo out to _cortex/ with a token; the wheel is
# built from it into deploy/wheelhouse/ and nothing else of it is needed.
_cortex/
# The repository's own history and git config (checkout credentials live there).
.git
# Install-time secrets and certificate material.
.env
**/.env
deploy/compose/.env
deploy/compose/tls/
